fundamentals_of_product_description_and_support
*)


(*"document_schema"
The subject of the *document_schema* is the citations of formal standards or documents that are outside the domain of this document. These resource constructs are used to reference additional information that is relevant to the description of the product.

[example]
====
International, national, and organizational standards, catalogues, and tables of engineering data are examples of formal standards or documents.
====

*)
(*"document_schema.__fund_cons"

Product data can include citations of other information sources.

[example]
====
Heat treatment processes documentation can be specified using the resource constructs that are defined in this schema.
====

*)
